ffs When Client Disconnects\n* #3621: Add TTL caching for cloud agent /enabled and session provider options\n* #3618: Copilot CLI: Fix Initializing Connections\n* #3614: Moved planAgent model config to core for picker UI\n* #3615: Add new command for starting a chat session in recommendations\n* #3611: Disable GH org polling\n* #3608: Ask agent provider for read-only Q&A mode\n* #3599: Move Pre/PostToolUse hooks to extension\n* #3609: Fix auto endpoint cache having stale tokens\n* #3610: Background - show badge in the agent sessions workspace\n* #3607: Don't continue to fetch auto token on stale sessions\n* #3605: nes: flush copilot-nes-oct cache and run external nes stests\n* #3602: Add workspace trust to lock file\n* #3601: Copilot CLI integration: add session pid tracking\n* #3604: update memory tool context\n* #3603: Session-memory based plan\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=405208&view=logs).</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/285093286/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}}